div.p:
3. In my despatch 976, December 23rd, the
                    difficulties arising at Montevideo between Paraguay and Bolivia are outlined,
                    and mention was made that the Foreign Office has in preparation an official note
                    dealing with these. This morning I received the note accompanied by copies of
                    the following official correspondence: 

First, memorandum Bolivian proposals;

Second, memorandum Paraguayan proposals;

Third, the Uruguayan formula;

Fourth, modifications requested by Bolivia;

Fifth, proposal offered by Paraguay;

Sixth, Bolivian refusal;

Seventh, new proposal by Paraguay.
